WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.680
I'm Tallow.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.788
I work the night desk.

00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:08.587
My head is a candle,
and the wax is the time I have.

00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:11.676
Every claim I check burns a little of it.

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:15.024
So before I look,
I ask you what you think.

00:00:15.564 --> 00:00:17.581
Then we find the source together.

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:20.602
Some claims hold up in the light.

00:00:21.142 --> 00:00:22.422
Some go blank.

00:00:22.962 --> 00:00:24.600
Either way, the call is yours.
